{"version":"95fa857c912d","heroes":[{"id":533,"en":"Agudo","cn":"阿古朵","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle","farm"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Abis pakai skill 3, Agudo tipis banget. Pilih momen buat fokus bunuh dia sebelum dia heal tim dan kasih buff.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":528,"strength":"hard","why":"Pet Agudo jadi target gratis buat numpuk basic attack Lam yang di-enhance (3–4 kali beruntun). Makin banyak target, makin gede damage dan heal skill 2. Abis ult Agudo, Lam bisa dive ke badannya. Artikel 2019–2022, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":150,"strength":"soft","why":"Batalin channel Release dan lompat ke badannya pas lagi kepisah dari pet."},{"hero":153,"strength":"soft","why":"Deketin pakai stealth buat batalin Release, terus burst badannya yang HP-nya rendah sebelum pet balik."},{"hero":524,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":112,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-heal","items":"Mortal Punisher (fisik) / Venomous Staff (magic)","why":"Musuh mengandalkan heal/lifesteal","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":545,"en":"Alessio","cn":"莱西奥","aliases":[],"roles":["farm"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":130,"why":"Skill 1 Musashi ngeblok peluru Alessio, dan ult-nya tetep kena Alessio walaupun dia lagi terbang.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":509,"why":"Control Dunshan motong skill 2 dan 3 Alessio, dan blok-nya ngurangin damage Alessio.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":111,"strength":"soft","why":"Burst dan dash Lady Sun ngalahin pendekatan stealth Alessio. Alessio udah mati sebelum asapnya ilang."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":514,"en":"Allain","cn":"亚连","aliases":[],"roles":["clash"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":121,"strength":"hard","why":"Skill 1 dan ult Mi Yue ngindarin ult Allain, dan skill 2-nya nyerap attack Allain."},{"hero":199,"why":"Arli punya banyak dash dengan sudut yang susah ditebak, jadi Allain yang jarak pendek susah nempel.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":137,"strength":"soft","why":"Silence dan burst Sima Yi kena Allain sebelum dia sempet numpuk combo, terus dive-nya menang trade."},{"hero":132,"strength":"soft","why":"Marco Polo nge-kite fighter melee pakai true damage. Allain gak pernah bisa nempel."},{"hero":537,"strength":"soft","why":"Magic damage jarak jauh dan mobilitas Devara jauhin fighter melee sepanjang laning phase."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":142,"en":"Angela","cn":"安琪拉","aliases":[],"roles":["mid"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Deketin Angela pakai jalur zig-zag (S) dan jangan kabur lurus. Semua skill-nya butuh prediksi arah, jadi gerak muter-muter sering bisa ngindarin. Hero melee terus pindah posisi pas nempel.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":131,"why":"Li Bai punya dua dash dan kebal control di skill 2, jadi bisa masuk ke Angela yang gak punya dash. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"soft"},{"hero":190,"strength":"soft","why":"Dash Kongming ngindarin skill shot. Begitu control Angela meleset, Angela gak punya jalan kabur."},{"hero":199,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":640,"en":"Annette","cn":null,"roles":["roam"],"classes":["Support"]},{"id":519,"en":"Ao'yin","cn":"敖隐","aliases":[],"roles":["farm"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":174,"why":"Skill 2 Consort Yu kebal damage fisik, padahal hampir semua damage Ao'yin itu fisik. Jangkauannya juga panjang.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":199,"why":"Skill 2 Arli nahan proyektil, termasuk serangan Fire Dragon Soul Ao'yin. Asal timing-nya pas, Arli menang di semua fase.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":169,"why":"Hou Yi menang trade di lane awal, dan ult-nya bisa stun Ao'yin sebelum dia sempet ult.","strength":"soft"},{"hero":508,"strength":"soft","why":"Jangkauan Garo lebih jauh dan nge-slow pendekatan. Ao'yin kepaksa jalan nembus poke."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":116,"en":"Arke","cn":"阿轲","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Jangan munggungin Arke, terus atur posisi. Arke roaming-nya efisien banget, jadi pas laning jangan adu sama musuh kalau lu gak tahu Arke lagi di mana.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":187,"strength":"hard","why":"Ult Donghuang gak bisa dihapus Purify, jadi Arke yang masuk langsung kekunci. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":156,"strength":"hard","why":"Ult Liang yang pasti kena di areanya ngunci Arke, lanjut skill 1 buat bunuh dia. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":189,"why":"Ult Guiguzi buka vision jadi stealth Arke kelihatan, dan tarikannya nge-control Arke. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":173,"strength":"soft","why":"Arke di awal ngandelin jungle dan susah gank sebelum level 4, sedangkan Fang cepet clear wave dan rotasi. Pasif \"nguping\" Fang ngebatesin stealth dari ult Arke. Pas di-gank, Fang bisa lihat gerakan musuh, kabur pakai slow ult + dash skill 2, terus burst pakai attack speed dari skill 1."},{"hero":137,"strength":"soft","why":"Pasif Sima Yi nampilin skill yang di-cast di deketnya, jadi Arke yang masuk pakai stealth bakal ketahuan."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-autoattack","items":"Spikemail / Ominous Premonition","why":"Musuh mengandalkan serangan biasa","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Assassin"]},{"id":199,"en":"Arli","cn":"公孙离","aliases":[],"roles":["farm"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Arah payung kertas nunjukin niat Arli, prediksi lebih awal. 2) Selincah apa pun Arli tetep tipis dan takut control, pertimbangin ini pas milih hero.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":106,"strength":"hard","why":"Ult Xiao Qiao otomatis ngunci target, dan skill 2 Arli gak bisa nahan itu (dipakai di KPL 2025)."},{"hero":133,"strength":"hard","why":"Katanya sering dipakai tim KPL buat lawan Arli (tanpa rincian mekanik)."},{"hero":192,"strength":"hard","why":"Jangkauan late game dan mode turret Huang Zhong ngalahin dive Arli. Arli gak bisa masuk zona itu."},{"hero":577,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":112,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":166,"en":"Arthur","cn":"亚瑟","aliases":[],"roles":["clash","jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Melee di lane jangan adu poke sama Arthur, pasti kalah. 2) Hero ranged bisa poke dia. 3) Pas HP rendah jauhin Arthur, ult-nya sakit banget buat target sekarat.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":111,"strength":"soft","why":"Jangkauan dan dash buat nge-kite silence. Dia gak pernah bisa nyentuh."},{"hero":196,"strength":"soft","why":"Jangkauan lebih jauh dari bruiser melee dan nge-poke dia keluar dari wave."},{"hero":192,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":123,"why":"True damage Lu Bu unggul pas trade di lane. Masih diperdebatin: sumber lain bilang Arthur bisa adu langsung asal ngindarin skill 1 Lu Bu. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"soft"}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":556,"en":"Ata","cn":"猪八戒","aliases":["Zhu Bajie"],"roles":["clash","jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Serang Ata pakai hit-and-run biar dia gak bisa bales sambil balikin HP. Jangan sejajar sama Ata dan tembok, biar gak kepaksa masuk fight dan mati instan.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":198,"strength":"soft","why":"Shield dan sustain tahan lawan drain, magic damage menang di adu panjang."},{"hero":163,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":121,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":157,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":503,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-heal","items":"Mortal Punisher (fisik) / Venomous Staff (magic)","why":"Musuh mengandalkan heal/lifesteal","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Tank"]},{"id":183,"en":"Athena","cn":"雅典娜","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Shield skill 1 Athena singkat, pecahin cepet terus control. 2) Pas dia ult jangan buang skill damage utama ke dia.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":178,"why":"True damage Yang Jian nembus shield Athena, efek execute-nya bikin Athena yang sekarat susah bales, dan burst-nya lebih tinggi.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":123,"why":"Pasif dan skill 1 Lu Bu kasih true damage yang nembus shield Athena.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":140,"strength":"soft","why":"Damage dasar skill Guan Yu tetep tinggi walaupun build tank, dan pas lari dia bisa dorong Athena."},{"hero":508,"strength":"soft","why":"Panah shield breaker plus jangkauan. Shield itu satu-satunya pertahanan Athena, dan itu gak bakal tahan."},{"hero":118,"strength":"soft","why":"Speed-up dan silence buat lepas dari dive. Reset-nya gak pernah kejadian."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":517,"en":"Augran","cn":"大司命","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle","clash"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":156,"why":"Ult Liang gak bisa di-purify dan jangkauannya jauh, jadi bisa ngunci Augran pas masuk.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":193,"why":"Ult Kaizer nahan damage kecil beruntun dari basic attack Augran, padahal itu sumber utama damage dan heal-nya.","strength":"soft"},{"hero":170,"strength":"soft","why":"Liu Bei menang duel jarak deket. Batas execute Augran gak pernah kesampean."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":120,"en":"Bai Qi","cn":"白起","aliases":[],"roles":["clash"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Bai Qi itu fighter-tank: HP tebel, damage reduction dari basic attack, regen cepet, taunt area luas. Di clash lane biasanya beli item regen, dan kalau gold-nya udah jalan dia susah dibunuh. Saran: Mi Yue/Lu Bu/Cheng Yaojin/Ata/Meng Tian/Li Xin/Guan Yu (clash), Diaochan/Garuda (mage), Zhuangzi (support), Di Renjie/Arli (marksman). Kalau sama-sama susah dibunuh, menangin lewat nyolong jungle dan kontribusi teamfight.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":113,"strength":"hard","why":"Pasif dan ult Zhuangzi ngelepas control, jadi taunt dari ult Bai Qi bisa digagalin."},{"hero":507,"strength":"hard","why":"Li Xin mode gelap lincah dan lama kebal control, jadi susah ditangkep taunt Bai Qi."},{"hero":141,"why":"Skill 2 Diaochan ngindarin ult Bai Qi, dan pasifnya kasih slow plus true damage.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":132,"why":"Marco Polo punya dua dash buat kiting, bisa ngebersihin control, dan kasih true damage.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":123,"why":"True damage Lu Bu tetep efektif lawan armor tinggi Bai Qi.","strength":"hard"}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-heal","items":"Mortal Punisher (fisik) / Venomous Staff (magic)","why":"Musuh mengandalkan heal/lifesteal","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-autoattack","items":"Spikemail / Ominous Premonition","why":"Musuh mengandalkan serangan biasa","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Tank"]},{"id":503,"en":"Biron","cn":"狂铁","aliases":[],"roles":["clash"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Biron kuat banget di clash lane dengan lifesteal, shield, dan dash, di awal susah nyari lawan yang berani adu. Tapi jangkauannya pendek dan gampang di-kite, tanpa flash susah masuk ke backline, jadi biasa aja di teamfight mid-late. Dia hero early game: Guan Yu/Mi Yue/Ma Chao/Sun Ce/Lu Bu (clash) asal gak mati sebelum level 4, sisanya 50:50. Marco Polo/Arli/Lady Sun (marksman), Diaochan/Sima Yi/Liang (mage), Sun Bin (support) juga bagus ngelawan dia.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":118,"strength":"hard","why":"Skill 2 Sun Bin kasih speed dan ult-nya nge-silence Biron, jadi burst Biron yang ngandelin skill langsung berhenti. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":123,"why":"True damage Lu Bu gak peduli perisai dan heal Biron, jadi ult perisai Biron gak ada gunanya lawan dia.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":139,"why":"Fuzi punya true damage dan damage reduction dari skill 2 buat nahan burst Biron, terus ult-nya ngunci Biron.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":132,"strength":"soft","why":"True damage Marco Polo nembus shield Biron, dan dash-nya jaga Marco tetep di luar jendela burst."},{"hero":125,"strength":"soft","why":"Poke dari jarak maksimal, shield-nya gak ada gunanya."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-heal","items":"Mortal Punisher (fisik) / Venomous Staff (magic)","why":"Musuh mengandalkan heal/lifesteal","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-autoattack","items":"Spikemail / Ominous Premonition","why":"Musuh mengandalkan serangan biasa","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":646,"en":"Butterfly","cn":null,"roles":["jungle"],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":184,"en":"Cai Yan","cn":"蔡文姬","aliases":[],"roles":["roam"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Assassin pick-off Cai Yan, dia lemah kalau sendirian. 2) Control skill 2-nya bisa dihindarin. 3) Pas dia ult, cari cara motong secepet mungkin.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":127,"strength":"hard","why":"Skill area Lady Zhen plus item anti-heal motong heal Cai Yan, dan control area-nya neken tim yang ngumpul. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":175,"strength":"hard","why":"Hook skill 2 Kui narik dan silence Cai Yan yang berdiri deket temen, mutus heal-nya, terus skill 1 dan ult ngabisin dia."},{"hero":152,"strength":"hard","why":"Skill 2 Wang Zhaojun nge-freeze Cai Yan, terus ult bisa langsung bunuh dia. Slow skill 1 bikin Cai Yan telat heal temen."},{"hero":182,"why":"Jangkauan super jauh Gan & Mo jaga dia di luar jangkauan skill 2 Cai Yan, dan burst late-nya hampir bunuh Cai Yan sekali combo. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":191,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Support"]},{"id":177,"en":"Chano","cn":"苍","aliases":[],"roles":["farm","jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":148,"strength":"soft","why":"Jangkauan Ziya lebih jauh dari Chano. Poke-nya ngikis Chano sebelum dia masuk jarak basic attack."},{"hero":157,"strength":"soft","why":"Burst dive Mai Shiranui ke marksman yang gak bisa gerak. Chano gak punya dash buat kabur dari combo."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":536,"en":"Charlotte","cn":"夏洛特","aliases":[],"roles":["clash"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Ngindarin atau motong skill Charlotte nyegah skill-nya ke-enhance, jadi ancamannya berkurang.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":199,"strength":"hard","why":"Arli punya banyak skill gerak, jadi skill Charlotte susah kena dia."},{"hero":121,"why":"Skill 2 Mi Yue nahan Charlotte buat dikuras, terus skill 1 dan ult untargetable-nya ngindarin skill Charlotte.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":193,"strength":"soft","why":"Burst dan damage reduction menang duel sebelum pasifnya numpuk."},{"hero":146,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":191,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":172,"en":"Chicha","cn":"蚩奼","aliases":[],"roles":["clash","jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":193,"why":"Blok Kaizer ngurangin basic attack Chicha yang sering tapi kecil, dan ult-nya nahan damage ult Chicha yang banyak hit.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":156,"strength":"soft","why":"Suppress Liang gak peduli mobilitas Chicha dan ngunci dia dari fight selama durasi penuh."},{"hero":509,"strength":"soft","why":"Dinding Dunshan makan proyektil Chicha, maksa dia main melee di tempat barisan shield bertahan."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":506,"en":"Cirrus","cn":"云中君","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Perhatiin sisa energi terbang Cirrus, pas kurang langsung serang. 2) Cirrus benci fight tarik-ulur. Poke dia pakai skill jarak jauh biar masuk mode fight dan energinya kekuras.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":129,"strength":"soft","why":"Armor reflect ngehukum damage DoT, dan true damage menang duel."},{"hero":531,"strength":"soft","why":"Mobilitas dan burst bisa ngejar pas dia terbang dan maksa dia mendarat."},{"hero":140,"strength":"soft","why":"Charge dan displacement maksa dia mendarat."},{"hero":146,"strength":"soft","why":"Mobilitas reset bisa ngejar dan burst abis dia mendarat."},{"hero":502,"strength":"soft","why":"Invade awal ngimbangin tempo dan menang duel."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Assassin"]},{"id":174,"en":"Consort Yu","cn":"虞姬","aliases":[],"roles":["farm"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Poke skill 1 Consort Yu bisa dihindarin. 2) Pas dia dateng gank, mundur ke tower lebih awal. 3) Kalau pakai assassin fisik, tunggu efek skill 2-nya abis baru cast skill.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":137,"strength":"hard","why":"Damage Sima Yi itu magic (gak ketahan skill 2 Consort Yu), dan dash-nya bisa ngejar sampai bawah tower."},{"hero":513,"strength":"hard","why":"Damage Shangguan itu magic dan dia untargetable pas terbang, jadi Consort Yu susah bales."},{"hero":123,"why":"True damage Lu Bu nembus kebal fisik skill 2 Consort Yu.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":157,"strength":"hard","why":"Burst magic dan dive Mai Shiranui gak peduli jendela kebal fisik Consort Yu."},{"hero":146,"strength":"soft","why":"Consort Yu itu marksman tipis, dan kebal fisik skill 2-nya gak berguna lawan Luna. Consort Yu susah kabur dari Luna yang lincah dan terus ngejar. Skill 2 Luna kasih shield gede buat nahan damage, dan ult-nya gampang ngindarin poke skill 1 Consort Yu."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-autoattack","items":"Spikemail / Ominous Premonition","why":"Musuh mengandalkan serangan biasa","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":191,"en":"Da Qiao","cn":"大乔","aliases":[],"roles":["roam","mid"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Cepet bunuh hero sekarat di dalem lingkaran biar gak di-teleport pulang. Di mid game tetep ngumpul biar musuh gak cepet kumpul dan ngeroyok.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":175,"strength":"hard","why":"Hook Kui narik Da Qiao atau temennya keluar dari lingkaran ult/teleport, jadi kebal dan teleport-nya putus."},{"hero":135,"why":"Efek dorong Xiang Yu maksa Da Qiao keluar dari lingkaran ult, padahal kebal dari ult-nya cuma aktif selama dia berdiri di dalem lingkaran.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":169,"strength":"soft","why":"Panah global batalin channel teleport dari seberang map."},{"hero":166,"strength":"soft","why":"Silence ngehentiin teleport, dan knock-up batalin reset."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Support"]},{"id":109,"en":"Daji","cn":"妲己","aliases":[],"roles":["mid"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Assassin masuk abis Daji pakai control. 2) Hindarin skill poke-nya. 3) Di late hero tipis jangan deket pas skill Daji ready, gampang mati instan.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":130,"why":"Skill 1 Musashi nahan semua skill Daji dan dia kebal control pas masuk. Dua tebasan crit cukup buat bunuh dia. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":167,"strength":"soft","why":"Skill 1 Wukong nahan satu skill musuh dan kasih kebal sesaat, kuat banget lawan Daji yang cuma ngandelin satu combo burst. Begitu combo Daji ketahan, Wukong tinggal pakai kebal + shield 4 detik buat bunuh dia."},{"hero":184,"strength":"soft","why":"Sustain dan control mantul batalin combo one-shot. Daji gak bisa nyelesaiin karena ada heal."},{"hero":119,"strength":"soft","why":"Wave clear Daji di awal lemah, AoE Dr Bian lebih cepet, jadi Dr Bian unggul gold dan level. Di early-mid Daji belum bisa one-combo Dr Bian, dan pas skill-nya cooldown Daji gak bisa ngapa-ngapain. Dr Bian yang punya heal dan awet di lane bisa neken Daji."},{"hero":131,"strength":"soft","why":"Daji simpel: lempar combo 2-3-1. Li Bai punya dash lincah dan skill kebal damage: poke pakai skill 2 + ult, engage pakai skill 1, terus ngindarin combo Daji pakai skill 2 atau ult pas Daji mau cast."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-heal","items":"Mortal Punisher (fisik) / Venomous Staff (magic)","why":"Musuh mengandalkan heal/lifesteal","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":537,"en":"Devara","cn":"司空震","aliases":["Sikong Zhen"],"roles":["clash","jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Cooldown transformasi Devara lama banget. Incer dia di jeda abis dia berubah.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":509,"why":"Perisai Dunshan nahan serangan Devara yang bentuknya proyektil, jadi damage-nya di teamfight ilang. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":193,"why":"Damage Devara itu berkelanjutan, bukan burst. Kaizer dengan ult (blok dan burst) menang adu deket. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":508,"strength":"hard","why":"Devara tangannya pendek dan gampang di-kite Garo. Serangan Garo mecahin shield Devara, dan kalau masuk lewat ult dia udah sekarat sebelum mendarat."},{"hero":137,"why":"Devara ngandelin selingan skill dan basic attack, jadi silence dan mobilitas Sima Yi motong ritmenya. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":169,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":134,"en":"Dharma","cn":"达摩","aliases":[],"roles":["clash"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Control skill 1 Dharma bisa dihindarin tinggal gerak. 2) Hero tipis waspadain dash Dharma. 3) Jangan biarin dia nendang lu ke pinggir tembok.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":506,"strength":"soft","why":"Cirrus terbang lewatin tembok, jadi Dharma gak bisa nendang dia ke dinding buat nge-trigger stun."},{"hero":129,"why":"Semua skill Dian Wei ngelepas control dan damage-nya tinggi, jadi control Dharma kurang ngaruh. Dari artikel setelah rework CN (Desember 2023).","strength":"soft"},{"hero":141,"strength":"soft","why":"True damage dan frame untargetable ngindarin combo dinding."},{"hero":183,"strength":"soft","why":"Athena kebal control, jadi Dharma susah knock-up dia dan gak bisa buka damage tahap kedua ult. Skill 1 dan 3 Athena itu magic damage, jadi armor fisik dari pasif Dharma gak ngebantu."},{"hero":170,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":133,"en":"Di Renjie","cn":"狄仁杰","aliases":[],"roles":["farm"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Di Renjie gak punya dash, assassin gampang bunuh dia. Tank yang kena ult-nya kehilangan armor dan magic resist, jadi ati-ati nerima damage.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":510,"why":"Sun Ce tebel dan sustain-nya kuat. Combo control-nya bisa bunuh Di Renjie yang tipis, bahkan abis dia lepas control.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":508,"why":"Jangkauan serang Garo lebih jauh, dan skill 2-nya kasih slow dan silence, jadi Di Renjie ketekan di lane.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":130,"why":"Musashi cepet deketin Di Renjie, dan skill 2 Di Renjie (pelepas control) gak bisa lepas dari kuncian ult Musashi. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":139,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":129,"en":"Dian Wei","cn":"典韦","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Hero damage jaga posisi pas teamfight dan serang Dian Wei dari jauh. 2) Tank yang HP-nya rendah jangan ngelawan Dian Wei pas ult-nya ready.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":111,"strength":"hard","why":"Lady Sun punya crit dan dash buat jaga jarak dari Dian Wei. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":174,"why":"Skill 2 Consort Yu kebal serangan fisik dan pasifnya kasih slow. Dian Wei susah deket.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":146,"strength":"soft","why":"Mobilitas reset buat nge-kite bruiser."},{"hero":199,"strength":"soft","why":"Arli punya banyak dash buat jaga jarak. Dian Wei susah nyentuh dia."},{"hero":141,"why":"Diaochan kebal sesaat di skill 2 dan cooldown dash-nya pendek. Slow-nya bikin Dian Wei gak bisa ngejar.","strength":"soft"}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-autoattack","items":"Spikemail / Ominous Premonition","why":"Musuh mengandalkan serangan biasa","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":141,"en":"Diaochan","cn":"貂蝉","aliases":[],"roles":["mid","clash"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Assassin masuk abis Diaochan pakai dash. 2) Pakai hero hard CC: kunci terus bunuh begitu dia masuk. 3) Jangan berdiri rapet biar AoE-nya gak kena banyak orang.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":156,"strength":"hard","why":"Skill 1 dan ult Zhang Liang ngunci Diaochan. Ult-nya susah lepas, bahkan pakai Purify."},{"hero":187,"why":"Ult Donghuang suppress Diaochan yang ngandelin lompat terus-terusan. Ditambah damage tim, dia gak bisa kabur.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":109,"strength":"soft","why":"Diaochan takut hard CC dan burst fokus. Burst single target Daji tinggi, bisa bunuh Diaochan pakai combo 2-3-1 sebelum dia sempet gerak. Tunggu Diaochan pakai skill 2 (ngilang), baru stun dan combo. Di mid-late kalau Daji unggul gold, Diaochan full HP pun bisa mati."},{"hero":139,"why":"Ult Fuzi ngurung Diaochan abis dia pakai Purify dan skill 2, dan skill 2 Fuzi ngurangin damage-nya.","strength":"soft"},{"hero":537,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-heal","items":"Mortal Punisher (fisik) / Venomous Staff (magic)","why":"Musuh mengandalkan heal/lifesteal","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":159,"en":"Dolia","cn":"朵莉亚","aliases":[],"roles":["roam"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":137,"strength":"soft","why":"Sima Yi dive ke support di backline. Silence-nya nyegah Dolia nge-refresh ult carry."},{"hero":189,"strength":"soft","why":"Engage stealth grup dari Guiguzi nangkep support yang gak bisa gerak sebelum dia sempet reset fight."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Support"]},{"id":187,"en":"Donghuang","cn":"东皇太一","aliases":[],"roles":["roam","clash"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Di awal Donghuang susah last-hit dari jauh dan agak lemah, jadi tekan farm-nya. Pas ult-nya ngunci temen lu, jangan serang dia, soalnya damage yang dia terima diterusin ke temen yang kekunci.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":184,"strength":"hard","why":"Heal cepet Cai Yan bikin target ult Donghuang tetep hidup, jadi ult itu malah ngerugiin Donghuang."},{"hero":132,"strength":"hard","why":"Dash Marco Polo bikin Donghuang susah deket, dan serangan jarak jauhnya terus nguras Donghuang. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":106,"strength":"soft","why":"Lewat pasif speed abis skill 2 kena plus poke skill 1 terus-terusan, Xiao Qiao jaga jarak dari Donghuang, jadi bola energi di sekitarnya gak bisa nyentuh Xiao Qiao buat heal. Donghuang cuma bisa di-kite."},{"hero":111,"strength":"soft","why":"Area ult Donghuang kecil dan dia cuma heal pas bola energinya nyentuh musuh, jadi jangkauan super jauh Lady Sun counter dia. Control skill 2 Donghuang sampai 1 detik tapi jedanya lama, jarang kena Lady Sun yang punya dash. Ult-nya control kuat tapi jangkauannya kelemahan. Kalau gak bisa deketin Lady Sun, dia kekikis sampai mati."},{"hero":119,"strength":"soft","why":"Donghuang di awal kuat invade jungle. Dr Bian beda dari mid lain: numpuk pasif lewat basic attack. Pas Donghuang masuk ke blue buff tim, Dr Bian bisa terus poke pakai basic attack dan skill tanpa perlu adu deket, jadi invade Donghuang melemah dan musuh gak dapet momentum awal."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-heal","items":"Mortal Punisher (fisik) / Venomous Staff (magic)","why":"Musuh mengandalkan heal/lifesteal","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-autoattack","items":"Spikemail / Ominous Premonition","why":"Musuh mengandalkan serangan biasa","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Support"]},{"id":119,"en":"Dr Bian","cn":"扁鹊","aliases":[],"roles":["mid"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Dr Bian itu mage jarak deket, lemah bantu tim di awal tapi bisa heal dan damage, kuat teamfight di mid-late. Minusnya: jangkauan pendek, gak punya control, takut burst. Counter efektif: Diaochan/Shi/Mai Shiranui/Wang Zhaojun (mid), Da Qiao/Zhang Fei (support). 1) Lemah sendirian, bisa di-pick-off. 2) Skill-nya bisa dihindarin. 3) Pas tumpukan pasifnya udah tinggi, keluar dari area ult-nya.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":153,"why":"Gao Changgong deketin lewat stealth, dan burst-nya bunuh Dr Bian yang gak punya dash sebelum heal-nya sempet ngaruh.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":110,"why":"Garuda nguras Dr Bian dari jarak jauh, jadi pasif racunnya gak sempet jalan.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":182,"why":"Damage jarak jauh Gan & Mo, apalagi skill yang udah di-enhance di late, bisa langsung bunuh Dr Bian. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":157,"why":"Mai lincah dan punya knock-up. Dr Bian tanpa dash susah kabur dari combo-nya.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":167,"why":"Wukong bisa langsung bunuh Dr Bian yang gak punya dash maupun control. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":126,"en":"Dun","cn":"夏侯惇","aliases":[],"roles":["clash","roam","jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Hindarin control Dun tinggal gerak. 2) Hero lincah bisa nge-kite dia. 3) Pas sekarat jangan adu sama Dun yang juga sekarat, waspadain pasif regen-nya.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":121,"strength":"hard","why":"Mi Yue jangkauannya panjang buat nge-kite Dun yang tangannya pendek. Ult-nya kasih lifesteal dan kebal control."},{"hero":123,"why":"True damage Lu Bu nembus shield Dun. Di awal Dun masih kuat berkat lifesteal pasif, tapi Lu Bu unggul mulai mid game.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":111,"strength":"soft","why":"Jangkauan dan dash buat nge-kite tank. Dia gak pernah bisa bertahan di jarak melee."},{"hero":132,"strength":"soft","why":"True damage dan kiting Marco Polo ngalahin brawler tebel. Dun gak pernah sempet deket."},{"hero":159,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-heal","items":"Mortal Punisher (fisik) / Venomous Staff (magic)","why":"Musuh mengandalkan heal/lifesteal","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Tank"]},{"id":509,"en":"Dunshan","cn":"盾山","aliases":["Dun Shan"],"roles":["roam"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Ganggu dari banyak arah biar Dunshan kewalahan. Sabar mancing bisa nembus pertahanan timnya. 2) Pilih hero dengan dash jauh buat ngelompatin Dunshan dan nyerang backline.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":105,"strength":"hard","why":"Control area dan super armor Lian Po batalin skill 1 Dunshan dan bikin dia kebal skill 2 Dunshan. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":124,"strength":"soft","why":"Api Zhou Yu nyerang dari tanah, jadi perisai depan Dunshan gak bisa nahan. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":152,"strength":"soft","why":"Skill Wang Zhaojun jatuh dari atas dan gampang kena Dunshan yang geraknya lambat pas pegang perisai. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":112,"strength":"soft","why":"Pasif dan ult Luban No.7 gak bisa ditahan perisai Dunshan. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":114,"strength":"soft","why":"Knock-up dan stun Liu Shan motong stance shield Dunshan. Dindingnya jatuh dan backline langsung kebuka."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Support"]},{"id":577,"en":"Dyadia","cn":"少司缘","aliases":[],"roles":["roam"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":130,"why":"Musashi nebas proyektil skill Dyadia jadi tandanya gak nempel, dan ult-nya ngunci target.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":133,"why":"Skill 2 Di Renjie ngehapus tanda skill 2 Dyadia, jadi damage dan curian gold-nya batal (cuma satu dari dua cast).","strength":"soft"},{"hero":184,"strength":"soft","why":"Sustain dan control mantul Cai Yan lebih awet dari buff support Dyadia di fight panjang."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Support"]},{"id":155,"en":"Erin","cn":"艾琳","aliases":[],"roles":["farm"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Erin susah bertahan hidup, simpen control buat dia.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":199,"strength":"hard","why":"Damage dan mobilitas Arli di fase awal neken Erin di lane."},{"hero":106,"why":"Burst Xiao Qiao bisa ngabisin Erin sebelum lifesteal-nya sempet nolong. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":508,"strength":"soft","why":"Jangkauan lebih jauh dari marksman magic, dan shield break ngehukum build-nya."},{"hero":169,"strength":"soft","why":"Panah global dan DPS berkelanjutan ngalahin damage poke."},{"hero":196,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":173,"en":"Fang","cn":"李元芳","aliases":[],"roles":["farm","jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Itung damage ledakan tanda Fang. 2) Abis dash-nya kepake, cari momen buat nahan damage-nya.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":133,"strength":"hard","why":"Skill 2 Di Renjie ngehapus tanda dari skill 1 Fang, jadi ledakan damage-nya batal."},{"hero":174,"strength":"hard","why":"Skill 2 Consort Yu kebal damage fisik, termasuk ledakan tanda Fang. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":130,"why":"Skill 1 Musashi nahan proyektil Fang, dan ult-nya ngunci Fang yang tipis. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":199,"strength":"soft","why":"Payung Arli ngeblok tanda Fang dan dash-nya ngindarin serangan lanjutan."},{"hero":121,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":128,"en":"Fatih","cn":"曹操","aliases":["Cao Cao"],"roles":["clash","jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Hindarin tiga dash skill 1 Fatih, tahap ketiga kasih knock-up. 2) Abis ult aktif, lifesteal dan tenacity-nya kuat banget. Jangan adu langsung atau nyoba nge-control dia.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":180,"why":"Pasif Nezha ngurangin heal, padahal Fatih bertahan hidup dari lifesteal ult-nya.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":149,"strength":"soft","why":"Shield dan kehadiran global ngelindungin dari dive. Sustain-nya gak ngalahin damage carry."},{"hero":129,"strength":"soft","why":"True damage dan burst anti-heal ngalahin brawler sustain."},{"hero":119,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":174,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-heal","items":"Mortal Punisher (fisik) / Venomous Staff (magic)","why":"Musuh mengandalkan heal/lifesteal","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":542,"en":"Feyd","cn":"暃","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Feyd itu jungler super lincah, cepet bantu tim, dan jago ngabisin musuh, tapi lemah di level 1. Ganggu jungle-nya di awal buat ngacak ritmenya. Setelah level 4 backline jauhin tembok biar dia gak bisa ngabisin. Tekan dia di awal pakai jungler kuat kayak Pei, Cirrus, Wukong, tanpa gold di awal dia susah bangkit. Juga efektif: Chang'e/Diaochan/Jin Chan (mage), Zhang Fei/Liu Shan/Donghuang (support), Consort Yu/Di Renjie/Fang (marksman), Menki/Biron/Li Xin/Charlotte (clash).","naturalCounters":[{"hero":175,"why":"Hook Kui bisa narik Feyd turun dari dinding, pas geraknya kebatas dan gampang ditebak.","strength":"soft"},{"hero":128,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-autoattack","items":"Spikemail / Ominous Premonition","why":"Musuh mengandalkan serangan biasa","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Assassin"]},{"id":631,"en":"Florentino","cn":null,"roles":["clash"],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":583,"en":"Flowborn (Assassin)","cn":"元流之子(刺客)","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":193,"strength":"soft","why":"Burst dan ketahanan Kaizer menang 1v1. Assassin gak bisa reset abis engage pertama."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Assassin"]},{"id":582,"en":"Flowborn (Mage)","cn":"元流之子(法师)","aliases":[],"roles":["mid"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":193,"strength":"soft","why":"Burst dive Kaizer ngehapus mage yang diem sebelum cast-nya selesai."},{"hero":108,"strength":"soft","why":"Poke dan stun jarak jauh Mozi. Mage kepaksa jalan masuk ke control buat trade."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":584,"en":"Flowborn (Marksman)","cn":"元流之子(射手)","aliases":[],"roles":["farm"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":509,"strength":"soft","why":"Dinding Dunshan makan damage marksman. Backline gak pernah bisa DPS."},{"hero":528,"strength":"soft","why":"Lam dive ke marksman yang gak bisa gerak. Gak ada peel yang bisa nyelametin posisinya."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":585,"en":"Flowborn (Roamer)","cn":"元流之子(辅助)","aliases":[],"roles":["roam"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":137,"strength":"soft","why":"Sima Yi dive ke support, silence utility-nya, terus bunuh sebelum tim sempet bereaksi."},{"hero":189,"strength":"soft","why":"Engage grup Guiguzi nangkep support yang salah posisi, jadi lu yang nentuin kapan fight dimulai."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Support"]},{"id":581,"en":"Flowborn (Tank)","cn":"元流之子(坦克)","aliases":[],"roles":["clash","jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":121,"strength":"soft","why":"Sustain di lane dan ult untargetable Mi Yue ngalahin damage kecil Flowborn tank."},{"hero":199,"strength":"soft","why":"Arli nge-kite tank pakai reposisi tanpa batas. Tank gak pernah berhasil satu rotasi skill."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Tank"]},{"id":139,"en":"Fuzi","cn":"老夫子","aliases":[],"roles":["clash"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Control Fuzi bisa dihindarin pakai gerakan lincah. Hero tipis jaga jarak dari Fuzi pas fight.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":141,"why":"Diaochan lincah dan tetep bisa gerak pakai ult walaupun diiket Fuzi, jadi susah ditangkep.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":111,"strength":"soft","why":"Kiting. Bind gak pernah kena tanpa skill buat deketin."},{"hero":514,"strength":"soft","why":"Tekanan lane awal sebelum Fuzi beres item inti."},{"hero":193,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":191,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":182,"en":"Gan & Mo","cn":"干将莫邪","aliases":[],"roles":["mid"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Jangkauan dan lintasan pedang terbang Gan & Mo itu tetap, jadi mending cepet nempel. 2) Area pedangnya lebar tapi bagian tengahnya kosong dan gak kasih damage.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":130,"why":"Skill 1 Musashi nangkis pedang terbang Gan & Mo, dan ult-nya ngunci Gan & Mo jadi gak bisa kabur.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":199,"why":"Semua skill Arli kasih dash jadi pedang terbang Gan & Mo susah kena, dan skill 2-nya nahan proyektil pedang.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":131,"why":"Li Bai lincah muter ke belakang, skill-nya kasih kebal buat ngindarin pedang, terus burst-nya bunuh Gan & Mo.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":140,"strength":"soft","why":"Guan Yu salah satu dari sedikit hero yang bisa nahan Gan & Mo. Skill 1 dan flash Gan & Mo bisa ngindarin banyak skill, tapi Guan Yu tinggal muter ke belakang tower kedua lawan, dorong Gan & Mo pakai ult sampai gak bisa balik ke tower, dan dia pasti mati."},{"hero":162,"strength":"soft","why":"Gan & Mo gak lincah, takut hero yang nempel, dan karena jangkauannya jauh posisinya sering sendirian. Nakoruru tinggal muter ke belakang pakai ult terus bunuh dari deket."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":115,"en":"Gao","cn":"高渐离","aliases":[],"roles":["mid"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Gao itu mage jarak deket dengan AoE burst berkelanjutan, lumayan tebel berkat lifesteal ult, bahaya banget buat backline di early-mid. Minusnya jelas: jangkauan pendek, gak punya dash, butuh gold, lemah kalau ketinggalan. Gank dia sering di awal, dan pilih hero yang punya control atau lincah biar gak kena ult. Saran: Shi/Wang Zhaojun/Mai Shiranui/Yixing (mage), Sun Bin/Liu Shan/Dunshan/Ziya (support).","naturalCounters":[{"hero":187,"why":"Ult Donghuang ngunci Gao begitu dia masuk teamfight. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":118,"why":"Speed-up dan damage reduction Sun Bin nahan damage berkelanjutan Gao, plus slow dan silence ult-nya bikin Gao susah masuk.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":150,"strength":"soft","why":"Kiting. Gao kepaksa nerobos damage buat nyampe backline."},{"hero":157,"strength":"soft","why":"Mai Shiranui lawan Gao: di awal kipasnya bisa poke Gao yang jangkauannya pendek terus-terusan. Setelah level 4 burst Gao bisa dihindarin pakai dash Mai, dan pas ult Gao lagi gak ada, Mai gampang bunuh dia."},{"hero":182,"strength":"soft","why":"Poke dari luar jangkauan ult. Dia udah mati sebelum nyampe backline."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-heal","items":"Mortal Punisher (fisik) / Venomous Staff (magic)","why":"Musuh mengandalkan heal/lifesteal","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":153,"en":"Gao Changgong","cn":"兰陵王","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Tank tim nempel ke carry buat nahan pisau dan nge-control Gao Changgong begitu dia nongol. 2) Dia kasih damage lebih ke musuh yang sendirian, jadi jangan sendirian. 3) Abis kena pisaunya, menjauh biar gak kena damage lanjutan.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":196,"why":"Alat vision Shouyue ngebongkar stealth Gao Changgong, jadi dia susah nyergap.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":189,"strength":"soft","why":"Gao Changgong mainnya stealth deketin carry musuh terus bunuh backline. Ult Guiguzi kasih efek anti-stealth jadi posisinya ketahuan, abis itu control skill 2 dan pengurangan resist skill 1 bantu tim bunuh dia."},{"hero":505,"strength":"soft","why":"Skill 1 ngebuka stealth pas dia deketin, sebelum burst kena."},{"hero":117,"strength":"soft","why":"Gao Changgong itu assassin tanpa dash. Walaupun stealth ult-nya kuat, Wuyan bisa jaga deket backline tim dan pakai skill 1 dan 2 biar dia gak bisa deket. Kalau Gao berhasil bunuh backline, dia tetep kena petrify Wuyan: nyawa ganti nyawa."},{"hero":149,"strength":"soft","why":"Gao Changgong bunuh pakai combo abis skill 2. Liu Bang yang tebel susah dibunuh di mid-late: pas split push dia bisa adu langsung pakai slow dan control, pas teamfight ult-nya ngelindungin carry, dan skill 2 abis mendarat ngunci Gao buat kabur atau balik bunuh."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Assassin"]},{"id":508,"en":"Garo","cn":"伽罗","aliases":[],"roles":["farm"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Jangkauan Garo unggul, incer pakai assassin yang dash-nya kuat. 2) Makin cepet tower di belakangnya ancur, makin kebatas dia.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":153,"strength":"hard","why":"Gao Changgong bisa ngilang buat deketin Garo tanpa ketahuan, terus nge-burst dia."},{"hero":131,"why":"Garo minim mobilitas. Li Bai bisa dash dua kali dan pakai ult buat deketin terus bunuh dia.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":116,"why":"Garo gak punya dash. Assassin kayak Arke bisa masuk dan bunuh dia di early dan mid game.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":167,"why":"Garo gak punya dash. Wukong punya burst tinggi buat masuk dan bunuh dia.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":120,"strength":"soft","why":"Garo jangkauannya pendek dan gak punya dash, susah lepas dari skill 3 Bai Qi."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":110,"en":"Garuda","cn":"嬴政","aliases":["Ying Zheng"],"roles":["mid"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Assassin manfaatin Garuda yang salah posisi. 2) Hindarin skill 1-nya. 3) Ult Garuda bentuknya garis lurus, bisa dihindarin tinggal geser.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":153,"why":"Gao Changgong bisa deketin Ying Zheng lewat stealth terus langsung bunuh. Ying Zheng tipis. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":137,"why":"Sima Yi lincah jadi gampang nempel Ying Zheng, dan shield sihirnya nahan damage Ying Zheng. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":513,"why":"Shangguan cepet clear wave dan bisa bunuh Ying Zheng yang gak punya control. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":138,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":547,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":140,"en":"Guan Yu","cn":"关羽","aliases":[],"roles":["clash"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Pas Guan Yu lagi charge, hero tipis jaga jarak aman. 2) Pas teamfight jangan buang damage utama ke dia. 3) Pas skill 2 dan ult-nya ready, jangan pakai control utama ke dia.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":156,"why":"Skill 1 dan ult Liang kasih hard CC pas Guan Yu nyerbu.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":508,"why":"Skill 2 Garo kasih silence dan slow, jadi Guan Yu gak bisa ngumpulin charge. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":148,"why":"Skill 1 Ziya kasih slow dan ngurangin armor dalam waktu lama, jadi Guan Yu susah lari dan ngumpulin charge. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":111,"strength":"soft","why":"Kiting dan dash: charge dihindarin, terus burst masuk."},{"hero":157,"strength":"soft","why":"Guan Yu ngandelin banget pasif charge. Tiap skill Mai Shiranui, termasuk pasif, bisa mutus charge itu. Tanpa charge Guan Yu hampir kayak super minion. Mai itu counter alami Guan Yu."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":189,"en":"Guiguzi","cn":"鬼谷子","aliases":[],"roles":["roam"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Perhatiin gerakan Guiguzi dan selalu cek apakah lu kelihatan musuh. 2) Di late pas vision kurang, ati-ati serangan mendadak grup musuh.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":105,"strength":"hard","why":"Lian Po kebal control dan damage balasannya kuat, jadi Guiguzi susah masuk buat narik dia. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":187,"strength":"hard","why":"Ult Donghuang ngunci Guiguzi begitu dia masuk buat narik, terus tim bunuh dia. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":173,"why":"Fang bisa denger langkah musuh dari jauh, jadi Guiguzi yang ngilang tetep ketahuan sebelum sempet narik temen. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":135,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":171,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Support"]},{"id":150,"en":"Han Xin","cn":"韩信","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Han Xin takut control, kunci terus bunuh begitu dia masuk. 2) Dia tipis pas skill-nya abis, serang di situ. 3) Dia lincah banget cuy, jangan ngejar kejauhan, nanti timnya dateng ngebalikin keadaan.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":174,"strength":"hard","why":"Skill 2 Consort Yu kasih kebal damage fisik 2 detik, jadi serangan Han Xin meleset semua. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":156,"why":"Hard CC Zhang Liang ngunci Han Xin yang ngandelin gerak. Begitu kekunci, dia gampang dibunuh. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":109,"why":"Skill 2 Daji stun 1,5 detik, lanjut burst dari ult. Han Xin yang dive langsung mati kalau stun-nya kena. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":187,"why":"Ult Donghuang tetep bisa ngunci Han Xin walaupun dia lagi kebal control. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":166,"strength":"soft","why":"Han Xin ngandelin banget skill. Silence skill 1 Arthur gampang motong serangannya, terus skill 2 dan ult nguras HP Han Xin."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Assassin"]},{"id":521,"en":"Haya","cn":"海月","aliases":[],"roles":["mid"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":133,"why":"Skill 2 Di Renjie kerjanya kayak purify yang ngelepas efek ult Haya.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":121,"why":"Ult Mi Yue batalin ult Haya, dan rantainya terus nyerap attack Haya.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":193,"why":"Ult Kaizer nahan damage dan dia tebel banget. Walaupun ditarik ke ult Haya, Kaizer bisa ngebalikin duel.","strength":"hard"}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":563,"en":"Heino","cn":"海诺","aliases":[],"roles":["mid","clash"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":199,"why":"Skill 2 Arli nahan tembakan Heino, dan dia bisa masuk pas jeda lemparan terus menjauh pas Heino ganti ke jarak deket.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":509,"why":"Perisai Dunshan nahan tembakan skill 1 Heino dan matahin ritme serta tandanya, terus skill 2 narik Heino ke tengah tim.","strength":"soft"},{"hero":141,"strength":"soft","why":"True damage Diaochan nembus build tebel Heino, dan mobilitasnya jaga dia tetep di luar zona."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":169,"en":"Hou Yi","cn":"后羿","aliases":[],"roles":["farm"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Hou Yi tipis banget dan susah nyelametin diri. Pas nyerang perhatiin posisi. Kalau bahaya jangan basic attack, serang dari jauh pakai skill 2.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":107,"strength":"hard","why":"Ult Zilong lebih gampang kena ke Hou Yi karena dia gak punya dash. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":162,"strength":"hard","why":"Nakoruru cepet deketin dan burst Hou Yi yang diem di tempat pas nembak."},{"hero":175,"strength":"hard","why":"Hook Kui narik Hou Yi yang gak punya dash ke timnya, apalagi pas dia berdiri deket support."},{"hero":510,"why":"Sun Ce kebal control pas ult (kapal) dan langsung nabrak Hou Yi yang gak punya dash.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":123,"why":"Ult Lu Bu lompat ke backline. Walaupun Hou Yi punya control, Lu Bu tetep nyampe.","strength":"hard"}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-heal","items":"Mortal Punisher (fisik) / Venomous Staff (magic)","why":"Musuh mengandalkan heal/lifesteal","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-autoattack","items":"Spikemail / Ominous Premonition","why":"Musuh mengandalkan serangan biasa","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":192,"en":"Huang Zhong","cn":"黄忠","aliases":[],"roles":["farm"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Pas adu, jangan nginjek ranjau Huang Zhong. 2) Gank dia sebelum level 4 buat nahan farm-nya. 3) Serang gak lama abis dia pasang ult.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":123,"strength":"hard","why":"Lompatan Lu Bu kasih knock-up ke Huang Zhong yang lagi ult, terus tim bisa nyerang dia. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":108,"strength":"hard","why":"Skill 1 Mozi buat deketin, skill 2-nya damage-nya tinggi, dan pakai ult dia bisa ngunci Huang Zhong. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":153,"why":"Gao gampang nangkep dan langsung bunuh Huang Zhong. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":175,"strength":"soft","why":"Hook skill 2 Kui narik Huang Zhong, terus burst magic-nya bisa bunuh Huang Zhong tanpa bantuan temen. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":110,"strength":"soft","why":"Ult Garuda yang jangkauannya super jauh bisa kena Huang Zhong dari luar area ult-nya, maksa dia bongkar turret biar tim gampang bunuh dia. Kalau gak dibongkar, Garuda bisa solo kill."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-autoattack","items":"Spikemail / Ominous Premonition","why":"Musuh mengandalkan serangan biasa","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":531,"en":"Jing","cn":"镜","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Burst Jing tinggi banget. Pas dia ult, langsung keluar dari areanya atau dorong dia keluar.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":156,"why":"Ult Liang kasih control pasti ke Jing yang harus deket, dan skill-nya nahan Jing.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":187,"why":"Ult Donghuang gak bisa dihapus. Jing yang kekunci gak bisa ngapa-ngapain.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":135,"strength":"soft","why":"Xiang Yu tebel jadi susah dibunuh Jing, dan skill 1-nya dorong Jing keluar dari area ult-nya."},{"hero":528,"strength":"soft","why":"Displacement paksa narik Jing keluar dari zona cermin, damage-nya langsung anjlok."},{"hero":509,"strength":"soft","why":"Displacement dan dinding dorong Jing keluar dari zona cermin."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Assassin"]},{"id":193,"en":"Kaizer","cn":"铠","aliases":[],"roles":["clash","jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Skill 1 Kaizer bisa dihindarin. 2) Waspadain dash-nya, hero tipis jaga jarak biar gak di-engage.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":128,"strength":"hard","why":"Fatih kuat di duel side lane: ult-nya kasih heal gede, cukup buat menang 1v1 lawan Kaizer. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":154,"strength":"hard","why":"Mulan punya silence dan super armor, jadi Kaizer susah ngunci dan bisa mati sebelum ult-nya ready. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":129,"why":"Ult Dian Wei kasih true damage dan lifesteal. Dengan build semi-tank, dia gak bisa dibunuh sekali combo sama Kaizer.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":121,"why":"Rantai skill 2 Mi Yue ngurangin damage dan speed Kaizer, terus dash jauh dan ult kebalnya dipakai buat ngindar pas Kaizer lagi kuat.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":146,"strength":"soft","why":"Kiting. Mobilitas reset jaga dia tetep di luar jangkauan melee."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":190,"en":"Kongming","cn":"诸葛亮","aliases":[],"roles":["mid","jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Kongming bisa dash berkali-kali dalam waktu singkat, prediksi pas cast skill. 2) Pas ult-nya ngincer temen yang sekarat, berdiri di jalurnya buat nahan. 3) Perhatiin tumpukan pasifnya, pas dia bawa bola sihir menjauh.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":141,"why":"Skill 2 Diaochan ngindarin ult dan skill 1 Kongming, pasifnya nempel, terus combo-nya cepet bunuh Kongming. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":131,"strength":"soft","why":"Skill 1 dan ult Li Bai kasih kebal buat ngindarin skill Kongming, dan burst-nya bunuh Kongming yang tipis. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":137,"strength":"soft","why":"Silence batalin combo dash, dan burst menang adu."},{"hero":153,"strength":"soft","why":"Gao ngilang terus nyergap dan bunuh Kongming pakai burst sebelum dia sempet bereaksi."},{"hero":118,"strength":"soft","why":"Pas temen sekarat di depan Kongming, silence dari ult Sun Bin nahan skill Kongming biar temen bisa kabur. Pas Kongming sekarat dan kabur, silence ult juga nyegah dia pergi pakai skill 2."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":175,"en":"Kui","cn":"钟馗","aliases":[],"roles":["roam"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Ngumpet di belakang minion atau tank biar gak kena hook Kui. 2) Kalau kena, langsung dash buat kabur. 3) Waspadain Kui yang HP-nya rendah, bisa aja dia nerjang jadi bom bunuh diri.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":105,"why":"Lian Po tebel dan kebal control pas skill aktif, jadi hook Kui gak bahaya buat dia.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":187,"why":"Kalau Donghuang kena hook, dia malah ketarik ke backline lawan dan bisa langsung ult.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":113,"why":"Zhuangzi sering kebal dan ngelepas control, jadi dia bisa nahan hook Kui buat tim.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":533,"strength":"soft","why":"Pet ngalangin hook dan maksa hook-nya kena summon."},{"hero":117,"strength":"soft","why":"Hook Kui kuat banget di teamfight, tapi kalau dia narik Wuyan, satu ult Wuyan hampir bisa ngabisin tim lawan. Kui gak punya dash jadi rugi lawan Wuyan. Tanpa ult pun Wuyan yang ketarik bisa kabur pakai skill 1."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Support"]},{"id":111,"en":"Lady Sun","cn":"孙尚香","aliases":[],"roles":["farm"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Assassin masuk pas Lady Sun salah posisi atau udah pakai dash. 2) Dia lincah banget, tunggu momen buat control baru bunuh.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":132,"strength":"hard","why":"Marco Polo jangkauannya panjang, cepet clear wave, dan gak terlalu ngandelin item. Lady Sun yang butuh item gak dapet untung di lane awal."},{"hero":153,"why":"Stealth Gao Changgong bikin dia bisa deketin Lady Sun tanpa ketahuan, terus bunuh pakai burst. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":133,"strength":"soft","why":"Skill 2 Di Renjie ngebersihin tanda skill 2 Lady Sun (pengurang armor). Masih diperdebatin: sumber lain bilang Di Renjie justru takut burst Lady Sun."},{"hero":174,"strength":"soft","why":"Kebal physical ngeblok jendela burst, poke menang abis efeknya abis."},{"hero":131,"why":"Li Bai lincah banget buat ngejar, dan skill-nya ngindarin damage utama Lady Sun. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"soft"}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":127,"en":"Lady Zhen","cn":"甄姬","aliases":[],"roles":["mid"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Control Lady Zhen bisa dihindarin pakai gerakan lincah. 2) Pas teamfight jangan kedeketan sama temen biar AoE-nya gak kena banyak orang.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":113,"why":"Pelepas control Zhuangzi bikin tim gak kekunci control Lady Zhen. Dari artikel setelah rework CN (April 2024).","strength":"hard"},{"hero":153,"why":"Burst cepet Gao Changgong dari stealth bisa bunuh Lady Zhen sebelum dia sempet nge-freeze diri. Dari artikel setelah rework CN (April 2024).","strength":"hard"},{"hero":172,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":199,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":152,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":528,"en":"Lam","cn":"澜","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Control bisa motong kejaran Lam, jadi dia susah nempel buat kasih damage.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":139,"strength":"hard","why":"Skill 2 Fuzi kasih damage reduction gede, jadi Lam gak berani adu langsung. Ult-nya juga ngebatesin gerak Lam. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":135,"strength":"hard","why":"Hard CC dan stat tank batalin dive. Burst gak bisa nembus frontline buat bunuh."},{"hero":105,"strength":"soft","why":"Kebal CC dan hard engage ngehentiin dive. Tank tahan lewatin jendela burst."},{"hero":120,"strength":"soft","why":"Taunt batalin dive, dan build tebel selamat dari burst."},{"hero":556,"strength":"soft","why":"Sustain dan control tahan lawan dive, fight tetep jalan lewatin burst."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Assassin"]},{"id":168,"en":"Lapulapu","cn":"牛魔","aliases":["Niu Mo"],"roles":["roam"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Control Lapulapu itu skill shot, hindarin tinggal gerak. 2) Pas teamfight jangan abisin skill ke tank tebel ini. 3) Pas ult-nya ready jangan ngejar dia, balasan ult-nya gampang banget kena.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":113,"why":"Zhuangzi bisa ngelepas control diri sendiri dan tim, jadi control Lapulapu hampir gak ada gunanya.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":189,"why":"Guiguzi bisa ngilang dan nyergap duluan, jadi inisiasi Lapulapu yang gak selalu berhasil gampang dibales.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":118,"why":"Skill 2 dan ult Sun Bin (speed-up, heal, silence) matahin inisiasi Lapulapu dan bantu tim bales.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":132,"why":"True damage Marco Polo kuat lawan tank, dan dua dash-nya bikin Lapulapu susah ngejar atau nge-control dia. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":123,"why":"True damage Lu Bu nguras HP tank tebel kayak Lapulapu. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Support"]},{"id":131,"en":"Li Bai","cn":"李白","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Pas Li Bai maju poke pakai skill 1, jangan diladenin. 2) Pas ult aktif Li Bai ngindarin semua skill, jangan cast ke dia. 3) Jangan nyentuh lingkaran pedang skill 2, armor lu turun banyak.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":156,"strength":"hard","why":"Ult Zhang Liang langsung nahan Li Bai begitu dia masuk pakai skill 1."},{"hero":187,"strength":"hard","why":"Donghuang lumayan tebel buat nahan burst Li Bai, dan ult suppress-nya ngunci Li Bai begitu dia masuk."},{"hero":150,"strength":"soft","why":"Di early-mid keduanya imbang, sama-sama lincah. Tapi Han Xin di late dengan attack speed pasif dan efek skill bisa one-combo Li Bai, dan kemampuan ngejarnya ngebatesin dash Li Bai."},{"hero":118,"strength":"soft","why":"Begitu Li Bai masuk pakai skill 1, silence dari ult Sun Bin nahan dia di tengah musuh, jadi tim tinggal ngabisin."},{"hero":506,"strength":"soft","why":"Invade awal dan mobilitas udara ngehukum start yang lambat."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-autoattack","items":"Spikemail / Ominous Premonition","why":"Musuh mengandalkan serangan biasa","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Assassin"]},{"id":507,"en":"Li Xin","cn":"李信","aliases":[],"roles":["clash"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Mode komando: 1) Li Xin kuat banget ke satu arah tapi lemah dari arah lain, serangan mendadak bikin dia gagal ngisi tenaga. 2) Pas pakai serangan cepet dia gak kebal control, jadi di situ dia tipis. Paksa dia berhenti ngayun pedang. Mode ngamuk: 1) Kuat banget jarak deket tapi dash-nya gampang kebaca, jaga jarak. 2) Jangan ngejar kejauhan kalau gagal bunuh dalam satu serangan, dia bakal pulih dan ngebalikin keadaan.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":132,"strength":"hard","why":"Marco Polo lincah dan jangkauannya jauh, jadi bisa tarik-ulur Li Xin yang ngandelin jarak deket."},{"hero":509,"why":"Perisai Dunshan nahan skill 2, ult, dan basic attack berenergi Li Xin wujud cahaya karena semuanya proyektil. Gak berlaku buat wujud gelap. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":182,"why":"Gan & Mo nyerang dari jauh. Ult ditambah skill lain bisa langsung bunuh Li Xin di early game kalau pedangnya kena.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":109,"why":"Daji nunggu di semak terus pakai control dan burst. Li Xin yang kemajuan bisa mati sekali combo.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":175,"why":"Hook Kui narik Li Xin pas dia pakai skill 2, dan ult Kui ngunci target sambil kasih perisai.","strength":"hard"}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-heal","items":"Mortal Punisher (fisik) / Venomous Staff (magic)","why":"Musuh mengandalkan heal/lifesteal","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":105,"en":"Lian Po","cn":"廉颇","aliases":[],"roles":["clash","roam"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Jadi gini, skill Lian Po cooldown-nya lama. Pas lagi cooldown, poke aja biar pasifnya gak nyerap banyak damage. Tapi ingat, jaga posisi dan simpen dash buat cepet keluar dari jangkauan skill-nya biar gak di-control terus.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":121,"strength":"hard","why":"Mi Yue enak banget neken Lian Po di lane, susah ditangkep, terus ult-nya bisa ngindarin banyak skill dia. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":123,"why":"Lu Bu punya shield buat nahan damage Lian Po pas adu deket, plus damage-nya true damage. Ujung-ujungnya Lian Po kalah trade.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":119,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":503,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":199,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Tank"]},{"id":156,"en":"Liang","cn":"张良","aliases":[],"roles":["mid","roam"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Kalau kena damage berkelanjutan Liang, mundur dikit buat mutus biar pasifnya gagal. 2) Jaga HP tetep tinggi sebelum Liang pakai ult.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":182,"strength":"hard","why":"Jangkauan Gan & Mo lebih jauh dari Liang, dan pas Liang diem pakai ult dia gampang dibunuh."},{"hero":127,"why":"Lady Zhen neken Liang dari jauh, dan control-nya bisa motong ult Liang. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":175,"why":"Hook Kui narik Liang yang diem pas ult, sekalian motong ult-nya. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":168,"why":"Skill 2 Lapulapu nerbangin Liang dan motong ult-nya.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":196,"why":"Shouyue susah dijangkau ult Liang, dan jangkauannya cukup buat bunuh Liang duluan.","strength":"hard"}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":149,"en":"Liu Bang","cn":"刘邦","aliases":[],"roles":["clash","roam"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Pas gank Liu Bang jangan sejajar sama temen biar gak kena control skill 2 barengan. Pas dia channel ult, cepet bunuh temen yang dia teleport biar teleport-nya batal.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":139,"why":"Ult Fuzi ngiket Liu Bang jadi teleport-nya gagal, dan skill 2-nya ngurangin damage.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":168,"strength":"soft","why":"Hard engage dan knock-up batalin persiapan shield."},{"hero":521,"strength":"soft","why":"Tarikan misahin dia dari tim, shield global-nya jadi gak ada nilai."},{"hero":533,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":198,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Tank"]},{"id":170,"en":"Liu Bei","cn":"刘备","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Liu Bei ngandelin basic attack, hero tipis jaga jarak. Dia punya kebal control, jadi jangan pakai control pas ult-nya aktif.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":193,"strength":"hard","why":"Ult Kaizer ngeblok per hit, sedangkan basic attack Liu Bei banyak hit, jadi damage-nya banyak keblok."},{"hero":129,"why":"True damage ult Dian Wei nembus shield Liu Bei, dan dia unggul trade di mid-late game.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":508,"strength":"soft","why":"Panah shield breaker Garo ngerobek shield ult Liu Bei sebelum dia sempet deket."},{"hero":111,"strength":"soft","why":"Kiting. Bruiser jarak pendek gak pernah nyampe ke dia."},{"hero":135,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":114,"en":"Liu Shan","cn":"刘禅","aliases":[],"roles":["roam"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Liu Shan tanpa skill gak ada gunanya, pas teamfight jangan buang skill ke dia. 2) Dia jago kabur cuy, jangan abisin semua skill buat ngejar, nanti timnya dateng dan balik bunuh lu.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":113,"strength":"hard","why":"Kebal control Zhuangzi mutus rantai control Liu Shan, apalagi di teamfight."},{"hero":118,"why":"Skill 2 Sun Bin jauhin tim dari Liu Shan abis dia nerjang. Kalau control-nya gak kena, Liu Shan gampang dibunuh.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":123,"why":"Lu Bu nembus shield Liu Shan dan doyan fight jarak deket.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":152,"why":"Slow Wang Zhaojun gampang nge-freeze Liu Shan yang gak punya skill gerak. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":108,"strength":"soft","why":"Skill 1 dan 2 Liu Shan animasinya lama dan jangkauannya pendek. Mozi tinggal stun dan poke pakai skill 2, terus neken bareng tim."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Support"]},{"id":635,"en":"Lorion","cn":null,"roles":["mid"],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":123,"en":"Lu Bu","cn":"吕布","aliases":[],"roles":["clash"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Lu Bu kasih true damage yang nembus armor dan shield, kuat lawan hero tebel dan ber-shield, tapi lambat bantu tim dan kurang ngancem backline. Hero clash yang bisa ngimbangin: Mi Yue, Fuzi (jago bertahan di lane), Ma Chao (gerakannya licin), Yao (susah disentuh), Li Xin, Yang Jian. Gak neken penuh, tapi laning 50:50.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":132,"strength":"hard","why":"Dua dash Marco Polo bikin ult Lu Bu susah kena, plus ada true damage."},{"hero":507,"strength":"hard","why":"Li Xin mode gelap kebal control pas skill 1 dan bisa ngindarin ult Lu Bu."},{"hero":121,"strength":"hard","why":"Skill 2 Mi Yue kasih slow dan ngurangin serangan, plus ada lifesteal, jadi Lu Bu susah menang laning."},{"hero":139,"strength":"hard","why":"Skill 2 Fuzi ngurangin damage termasuk true damage, dan ult-nya ngiket Lu Bu."},{"hero":141,"why":"Skill 2 Diaochan cooldown-nya pendek dan kasih kebal, jadi dia bisa ngindarin damage sambil nge-kite Lu Bu.","strength":"hard"}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-autoattack","items":"Spikemail / Ominous Premonition","why":"Musuh mengandalkan serangan biasa","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":547,"en":"Luara","cn":"卢雅那","aliases":["Lu Yana"],"roles":["farm"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":133,"why":"Skill 2 Di Renjie ngebersihin blind dari ult Luara, terus dia bisa bales. Laning-nya juga kuat buat neken farm Luara.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":109,"why":"Skill Daji ngunci target, jadi gak meleset walaupun kena blind Luara. Luara gak punya skill gerak, gampang di-control.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":521,"why":"Ult Haya narik Luara ke ruang ilusi buat duel 1v1, dan blind gak ngaruh di sana.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":155,"strength":"soft","why":"Relasi counter resmi; belum ada catatan mekanik yang dipublikasikan."},{"hero":157,"strength":"soft","why":"Relasi counter resmi; belum ada catatan mekanik yang dipublikasikan."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":112,"en":"Luban No.7","cn":"鲁班七号","aliases":[],"roles":["farm"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Semua skill Luban bisa dihindarin tinggal gerak. 2) Jangan adu di bawah \"bantuan udara\" kecuali HP cukup. 3) Pas sekarat waspadain meriam mulut hiu dari ult Luban. 4) Assassin cari momen masuk.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":153,"strength":"soft","why":"Buat hero tanpa dash, Gao Changgong ancaman paling gede. Burst satu combo-nya neken banget Luban No.7 yang minim control dan gak punya cara nyelametin diri."},{"hero":116,"strength":"soft","why":"Hindarin skill 1 Luban (stun). Arke tinggal ult buat muter ke belakang dan kasih damage crit gede. Pas Luban flash, kejar pakai skill 2 terus bunuh. Kalau Luban tetep adu tembak, abis rentetan tembakannya Arke masuk dari belakang pakai skill 2."},{"hero":154,"strength":"soft","why":"Luban sakit di late tapi gak punya dash, cuma flash buat kabur. Mulan tinggal nunggu di semak, buka pakai skill 2 buat silence, terus ganti pedang berat dan combo control sampai Luban mati."},{"hero":126,"strength":"soft","why":"Walaupun tank, Dun full armor tetep sakit: skill 2 kasih true damage, ult-nya dash yang bisa buat maju atau mundur. Unggul banget lawan hero tipis jarak pendek kayak Luban No.7."},{"hero":127,"strength":"soft","why":"Luban gak punya dash. Pas teamfight, Lady Zhen tinggal taruh ult di kakinya: Luban kepaksa pindah, kena slow, jadi waktu damage-nya kepotong. Kalau Luban sampai pakai flash, assassin/fighter tim lebih gampang bunuh dia."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-heal","items":"Mortal Punisher (fisik) / Venomous Staff (magic)","why":"Musuh mengandalkan heal/lifesteal","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-autoattack","items":"Spikemail / Ominous Premonition","why":"Musuh mengandalkan serangan biasa","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":146,"en":"Luna","cn":"露娜","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Sebelum level 4 Luna hampir gak ada power. Gank dia di awal buat nahan farm-nya. 2) Simpen control sampai Luna masuk, baru bunuh.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":141,"strength":"soft","why":"Pas ngilang Diaochan untargetable, jadi ult Luna meleset dan langsung cooldown."},{"hero":109,"strength":"soft","why":"Luna kuat setelah level 4 dan susah dilawan kalau udah unggul. Control skill 2 Daji gak bisa dihindarin, jadi tiap lihat Luna tinggal poke pakai combo 2-3-1. Di bawah tower sendiri aman dari Luna, jangan push kejauhan, dan damage gede Daji di late tetep nyusahin Luna."},{"hero":133,"strength":"soft","why":"Begitu Di Renjie ngunci Luna, damage-nya bisa langsung bunuh atau minimal bikin Luna sekarat. Pas Luna udah masuk dan nandain Di Renjie pakai skill 1 atau 2, cleanse dari skill 2 Di Renjie bisa mutus rantai ult Luna."},{"hero":187,"strength":"soft","why":"Di teamfight setelah level 4, pas Luna masuk tinggal ult dia terus tim fokus. Kalau ada Donghuang, Luna jarang bisa engage atau poke duluan. Donghuang juga bisa maksa engage ke Luna, mati pun untung kalau tukeran sama Luna."},{"hero":191,"strength":"soft","why":"Rangkaian skill Luna itu kunci. Silence Da Qiao pas Luna mau cast bakal mutus rantainya, dan kebanyakan Luna langsung ilang ritme terus mati difokus."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":157,"en":"Mai Shiranui","cn":"不知火舞","aliases":[],"roles":["mid"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Jangan biarin Mai Shiranui nge-trigger pasifnya. 2) Pas teamfight jangan berdiri rapet biar skill 3-nya gak kena banyak orang. 3) Damage tinggi tapi tipis, pakai hero control buat nahan dia.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":187,"why":"Ult Donghuang ngunci Mai, jadi dia gak bisa kabur atau kasih damage.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":150,"strength":"hard","why":"Mai tipis. Han Xin punya banyak dash jarak jauh dan knock-up beruntun buat nempel dan bunuh dia. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":153,"strength":"hard","why":"Assassin burst tinggi: stealth Gao Changgong deketin Mai yang tipis dan ngabisin dia satu combo. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":109,"why":"Skill Daji itu single target dengan hard CC, jadi Mai bisa dibunuh satu combo.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":504,"strength":"soft","why":"Minion panggilan Milady nempel ke Mai Shiranui dan maksa dia clear minion terus. Wave clear Mai lambat, jadi dia gak bisa roam, padahal itu cara utama dia menang."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Assassin"]},{"id":132,"en":"Marco Polo","cn":"马可波罗","aliases":[],"roles":["farm"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Abis Marco Polo nyerang beberapa kali, jaga jarak biar dia gak burst pakai true damage. 2) Pas ult dia gak bisa gerak walaupun ada dash di awal. Simpen skill buat control, atau nyebar buat ngindarin burst-nya.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":199,"strength":"hard","why":"Dash Gongsun Li ngindarin skill 1 Marco Polo, skill 2-nya nahan proyektil, dan ult-nya motong ult Marco Polo. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":182,"strength":"soft","why":"Jangkauan lebih jauh dari marksman. Poke udah kena sebelum dia deket."},{"hero":155,"strength":"soft","why":"Magic damage gak peduli build physical, dan jangkauannya menang adu."},{"hero":504,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":167,"strength":"soft","why":"Marco Polo bisa poke dan kasih damage terus-terusan, dash-nya bantu lawan assassin. Tapi Wukong gampang dapet kebal + shield dari skill 1, skill 2 ngimbangin dash Marco, pasifnya bantu ngejar, dan basic attack yang di-enhance abis skill bisa bunuh Marco dalam satu combo."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-autoattack","items":"Spikemail / Ominous Premonition","why":"Musuh mengandalkan serangan biasa","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":564,"en":"Mayene","cn":"姬小满","aliases":[],"roles":["clash"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":170,"strength":"soft","why":"Liu Bei menang duel jarak deket. Combo Mayene gak bisa nembus sustain-nya."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":524,"en":"Meng Ya","cn":"蒙犽","aliases":[],"roles":["farm"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Waspadain bantuan jarak super jauh Meng Ya. 2) Perhatiin bar energinya, jangan adu pas dia lagi mode semangat.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":187,"why":"Ult Donghuang ngunci Meng Ya yang gak punya skill gerak, dan gak bisa dihindarin. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":153,"why":"Gao Changgong deketin lewat stealth terus burst. Meng Ya gak punya skill gerak maupun hard CC. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":129,"why":"Dian Wei tebel dan bisa pakai Thorns, jadi damage Meng Ya mantul balik. Ult-nya menang duel. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"soft"},{"hero":175,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":123,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":198,"en":"Menki","cn":"梦奇","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle","clash"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Pas Menki gendut, jangan deketin. Dia lambat, serang dari jauh sambil gerak dan simpen dash buat ngindarin skill-nya. Pas dia kurus, simpen control buat nge-slow terus fokus pas dia tipis.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":123,"why":"True damage Lu Bu nembus perisai skill 1 Menki, dan perisai skill 2 Lu Bu lebih gede dari punya Menki. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":141,"why":"Diaochan lincah, punya slow dan true damage tinggi, jadi bisa nempel Menki. Tapi Menki masih bisa kabur keluar area ult-nya. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":132,"why":"Marco Polo lincah, dan true damage-nya bikin tank kayak Menki berasa hero tipis. Tetep butuh control dari tim. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":109,"strength":"soft","why":"Combo burst ngancurin shield sebelum sempet dipasang lagi."},{"hero":199,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":121,"en":"Mi Yue","cn":"芈月","aliases":[],"roles":["clash","jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Kekuatan Mi Yue ada di split push dan duel, hampir gak ada lawan, tapi butuh gold banget. Kalau awalnya gak jalan, dia lemah di teamfight late. Saran: Yango/Meng Tian/Ma Chao/Fuzi (clash), Luna (jungle), Sima Yi/Liang (mage), Donghuang (support), Di Renjie/Arli (marksman). Tanpa control susah bunuh Mi Yue, jadi di awal cukup tahan dia dan jaga jungle.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":156,"strength":"hard","why":"Hard CC Liang ngebatesin gerak Mi Yue."},{"hero":140,"strength":"hard","why":"Charge dan displacement batalin drain, sustain-nya gak sempet numpuk."},{"hero":133,"strength":"soft","why":"Skill 2 Di Renjie ngelepas rantai skill 2 Mi Yue, dan jangkauan serangnya jauh."},{"hero":125,"strength":"soft","why":"Poke dari jarak maksimal plus control boneka bikin Mi Yue gak pernah bisa nempel buat drain."},{"hero":180,"why":"Pasif Nezha ngurangin heal, padahal Mi Yue ngandelin lifesteal.","strength":"soft"}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-autoattack","items":"Spikemail / Ominous Premonition","why":"Musuh mengandalkan serangan biasa","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":504,"en":"Milady","cn":"米莱狄","aliases":[],"roles":["mid"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Minion mekanik cuma hidup 8 detik, jadi tarik fight ke tempat jauh dan bunuh Milady pas dia lagi nyiapin minion. 2) Pakai tank yang punya dash buat nahan ult dan damage-nya, biar ult dan minion gak ngunci carry tim. Ancaman teamfight-nya langsung turun.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":148,"strength":"soft","why":"Tiap unit panggilan Milady kasih XP pasif ke Ziya, jadi wave clear-nya bikin level dia naik lebih cepet."},{"hero":124,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":152,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":127,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":501,"en":"Ming","cn":"明世隐","aliases":[],"roles":["roam"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Abis kena rantai, langsung mundur. 2) Abis Ming pakai ult, langsung serang dan bunuh.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":127,"strength":"soft","why":"Pantulan kena dua hero yang lagi terhubung."},{"hero":175,"strength":"soft","why":"Hook narik carry yang terhubung keluar dari posisi."},{"hero":139,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":171,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":156,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Support"]},{"id":108,"en":"Mozi","cn":"墨子","aliases":[],"roles":["mid","roam"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Hindarin control jarak jauh skill 2 Mozi. 2) Jangan berdiri kedeketan sama temen biar ult Mozi gak kena banyak orang.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":504,"why":"Minion Milady nahan skill 2 Mozi, jadi Mozi susah kena musuh di lane.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":509,"why":"Shield skill 1 Dunshan ngeblok proyektil skill 2 Mozi, dan skill-nya bisa nge-control Mozi. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":105,"why":"Shield dan kebal control pas Lian Po pakai skill bikin skill 2 Mozi gak bisa nahan dia.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":118,"why":"Silence dari ult Sun Bin bisa motong skill Mozi, dan skill 2-nya bantu ngindarin damage.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":154,"strength":"soft","why":"Kekuatan Mozi ada di control dan poke. Skill 2 Mulan + basic attack bisa silence Mozi, mode pedang berat kebal control, dan damage reduction-nya bikin Mulan gak gampang di-burst. Menang 1v1 maupun teamfight."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-autoattack","items":"Spikemail / Ominous Premonition","why":"Musuh mengandalkan serangan biasa","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":154,"en":"Mulan","cn":"花木兰","aliases":[],"roles":["clash"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Mulan mode pedang ganda itu tipis, bunuh cepet. Mode pedang berat lebih lambat, hindarin skill-nya pakai dash.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":128,"strength":"hard","why":"Fatih makin kuat dan balikin HP. Skill 1-nya ngindarin skill Mulan dan ult-nya ngelepas control."},{"hero":166,"strength":"soft","why":"Silence Arthur motong combo Mulan, dia aman di fase awal, dan ult-nya bisa execute."},{"hero":113,"strength":"soft","why":"Mulai mid game Mulan gak bisa adu langsung sama Zhuangzi. Zhuangzi kebal control jadi banyak skill Mulan kebuang, dan pasif + skill 2-nya kesakitan buat Mulan yang tipis. Sekarat pun Zhuangzi gampang kabur."},{"hero":156,"strength":"soft","why":"Suppress Liang ngunci Mulan dari combo pedang berat. Dia gak bisa beresin satu rotasi skill pun."},{"hero":121,"strength":"soft","why":"Sustain dan frame untargetable Mi Yue nge-netralin burst Mulan. Mulan gak punya jawaban buat drain-nya."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":130,"en":"Musashi","cn":"宫本武藏","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Hindarin skill 1 Musashi. 2) Hero tipis berdiri di belakang, sekali kena ult Musashi susah kabur.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":187,"why":"Ult Donghuang ngunci Musashi pas dia mendarat abis ult.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":193,"why":"Kaizer tahan diajak duel langsung, dan bisa bales pakai ult sambil balikin HP.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":129,"strength":"soft","why":"True damage nembus damage reduction dan menang duel panjang."},{"hero":170,"strength":"soft","why":"Hard CC Musashi cuma knock-up pas skill 3 mendarat, plus slow skill 1 abis itu. Pas duel, Liu Bei pancing skill 3 Musashi dulu, terus pakai skill 3 sendiri (kebal control) dan tinggal berdiri nembak sampai Musashi mati."},{"hero":135,"strength":"soft","why":"Ancaman terbesar Musashi itu ult buat nyerang hero tipis, tapi ada jedanya. Xiang Yu bisa manfaatin jeda itu buat dorong Musashi jauh dari marksman atau mage tim."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-autoattack","items":"Spikemail / Ominous Premonition","why":"Musuh mengandalkan serangan biasa","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":162,"en":"Nakoruru","cn":"娜可露露","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Abis ditandain mata elang, hindarin serangan Nakoruru. 2) Damage tinggi dan lincah, butuh control buat ngunci baru bunuh.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":167,"strength":"hard","why":"Skill 1 Wukong nahan satu serangan dan kasih shield, terus dia bales burst Nakoruru."},{"hero":131,"strength":"hard","why":"Li Bai lincah, dan skill 2 plus ult-nya kebal, jadi skill Nakoruru meleset."},{"hero":533,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":506,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":118,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Assassin"]},{"id":180,"en":"Nezha","cn":"哪吒","aliases":[],"roles":["clash","jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Hero tipis jaga jarak. 2) Jangan pakai control utama ke Nezha.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":198,"strength":"hard","why":"Pemain Nezha high rank nyebut Menki lawan lane paling ditakutin: di awal game Nezha jangan adu langsung sama Menki. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":154,"strength":"hard","why":"Guide nyebut Mulan sebagai counter fighter kayak Nezha (tanpa rincian mekanik). Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":135,"why":"Efek dorong dan knock-up Xiang Yu mentalin Nezha yang nyerbu backline, jadi temen bisa jaga jarak dan nyerang dia.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":191,"why":"Pas Nezha ult buat ngejar, Da Qiao tetep bisa ngirim temen yang diincer pulang ke base, jadi serbuan Nezha sia-sia.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":156,"strength":"soft","why":"Suppression ngehentiin dive global begitu dia mendarat."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","item