uh skill 2-nya) atau temennya, terus ult ngunci dia.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":111,"strength":"soft","why":"Kiting dan burst ngalahin heal. Support gak bisa nutup damage pakai sustain."},{"hero":533,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Support"]},{"id":513,"en":"Shangguan","cn":"上官婉儿","aliases":[],"roles":["mid"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Perhatiin jalur skill 2 buat nebak arah serangannya. 2) Simpen control buat motong ult Shangguan, ancamannya langsung turun jauh.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":199,"strength":"soft","why":"Mobilitas dan blok proyektil ngindarin combo terbangnya."},{"hero":149,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":137,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":193,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":523,"en":"Shi","cn":"西施","aliases":[],"roles":["mid"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Shi itu mage control dengan burst rendah dan ngandelin banget tim, sering jadi hero utility. Hero lincah berjangkauan jauh gampang counter dia. Saran: Jin Chan/Diaochan/Shangguan/Sima Yi/Shen Mengxi/Nuwa/Mozi (mid), Lam/Gao Changgong/Arke (jungle), Lian Po/Zhuangzi (support).","naturalCounters":[{"hero":116,"why":"Arke deketin Shi tanpa ketahuan lewat stealth, terus bunuh dia. Shi gak punya skill gerak. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":105,"why":"Lian Po kebal control selama pakai skill, jadi control Shi gak ngaruh, dan dia bisa langsung nerjang Shi. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":113,"why":"Kebal control Zhuangzi plus ult yang ngebersihin control tim matahin control Shi. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":133,"why":"Skill 2 Di Renjie ngebersihin iketan skill 1 Shi sebelum tarikan kedua. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"soft"}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":196,"en":"Shouyue","cn":"百里守约","aliases":[],"roles":["farm"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Pas Shouyue pakai skill 2, terjang ke deketnya biar dia batalin. 2) Skill area bisa kena Shouyue yang lagi nyamar.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":184,"strength":"hard","why":"Heal Cai Yan balikin HP yang dikikis tembakan Shouyue, dan skill 2-nya bisa nge-control Shouyue."},{"hero":108,"why":"Skill 2 Mozi jangkauannya jauh dan kasih control, jadi motong bidikan Shouyue sekalian ngikis HP-nya.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":509,"why":"Perisai Dunshan nahan semua skill dan basic attack Shouyue, jadi tembakan jarak jauhnya gak nyampe ke tim. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":179,"why":"Skill Nuwa jangkauannya jauh. Pas Shouyue lagi ngebidik dan posisinya kelihatan, ult Nuwa bisa kena dia.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":169,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Marksman"]},{"id":137,"en":"Sima Yi","cn":"司马懿","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle","mid"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Sima Yi di awal kekurangan energi. Paksa dia keluar dari zona silence biar gak bisa balikin energi. 2) Pasif skill 2 ngubah sebagian magic damage yang udah diterima jadi heal, bukan ngurangin damage langsung.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":193,"strength":"hard","why":"Kaizer dengan ult ready gak takut Sima Yi. Ult-nya kasih blok dan nambah damage buat bales."},{"hero":187,"why":"Ult Donghuang ngunci lama, jadi Sima Yi yang ngandelin dash gak bisa kabur.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":170,"strength":"soft","why":"Burst jarak deket dan kebal control ngalahin dive yang pakai silence."},{"hero":198,"strength":"soft","w