"},{"hero":187,"why":"Ult Donghuang neken hero apa pun dan ngehentiin kapal Sun Ce, walaupun Sun Ce lagi super armor. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":141,"why":"True damage Diaochan nembus armor dari pasif Sun Ce, dan kelincahannya bikin ult Sun Ce gampang dihindarin.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":537,"strength":"soft","why":"Magic damage Devara nembus tumpukan armor Sun Ce, dan jangkauannya jauhin Sun Ce dari engage."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":163,"en":"Ukyo Tachibana","cn":"橘右京","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle","clash"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Skill 2 Ukyo bisa dihindarin tinggal gerak. 2) Pas dia ult, langsung ngindar. 3) Gank Ukyo abis dia pakai skill 1, peluang berhasilnya lebih gede.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":166,"why":"Arthur tebel dan bisa balikin HP. Silence skill 1 dan ult-nya motong combo Ukyo. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":126,"why":"Dun tebel banget dengan shield skill 2, dan dua control-nya bikin Ukyo gak bisa bales. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":178,"why":"Yang Jian tebel dan sustain, bisa nempel Ukyo jadi dia gak bisa jaga jarak. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":111,"strength":"soft","why":"Kiting. Assassin jarak pendek udah abis di-poke sebelum sempet engage."},{"hero":531,"strength":"soft","why":"Setelah level 4, zona cermin bisa ngindarin control dan ult."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Assassin"]},{"id":558,"en":"Umbrosa","cn":"影","aliases":[],"roles":["clash","jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":193,"strength":"soft","why":"Burst dan damage reduction Kaizer menang duel. Umbrosa gak bisa tahan lewatin jendela ult."},{"hero":141,"strength":"soft","why":"True damage dan frame untargetable bikin Diaochan bisa nari-nari di sekitar combo melee Umbrosa."},{"hero":116,"strength":"soft","why":"Burst stealth dari belakang Arke ngehapus Umbrosa sebelum sustain-nya jalan."},{"hero":120,"strength":"soft","why":"Damage multi-hit Umbrosa nge-trigger pasif counter Bai Qi, dan taunt-nya ngehentiin combo dia."},{"hero":517,"strength":"soft","why":"Sustain dan batas execute Augran ngalahin brawler multi-hit di trade panjang."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":138,"en":"Wang Wei","cn":"王维","aliases":["Wang Wei"],"roles":["mid"],"howToPlayAgainst":null,"naturalCounters":[{"hero":109,"strength":"soft","why":"Relasi counter resmi; belum ada catatan mekanik yang dipublikasikan."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":152,"en":"Wang Zhaojun","cn":"王昭君","aliases":[],"roles":["mid","roam"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Gerakan lincah buat ngindarin poke dan control Wang Zhaojun. 2) Pas teamfight pakai assassin buat bunuh dia. 3) Simpen control buat motong ult-nya.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":113,"why":"Zhuangzi kebal control dan ult-nya ngelepas control tim, jadi freeze Wang Zhaojun gak ngehentiin dia.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":131,"why":"Skill 2 dan ult Li Bai bikin dia untargetable, jadi susah di-freeze Wang Zhaojun.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":153,"why":"Assassin burst kayak Gao Changgong bisa nangkep Wang Zhaojun yang sendirian dan tipis.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":105,"strength":"soft","why":"Wang Zhaojun ngandelin banget control skill 2. Lian Po tebel jadi susah dibunuh walaupun kena ult Wang Zhaojun, skill 1 dan 3 Lian Po bisa motong ult-nya, dan control Lian Po bisa nahan Wang Zhaojun buat dibunuh tim."},{"hero":110,"strength":"soft","why":"Ult Garuda bisa nembak Wang Zhaojun dari luar area ult-nya, maksa dia flash atau batalin ult, jadi tim lebih aman bunuh dia."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-burst","items":"Succubus Cloak (vs magic) / Destiny","why":"Musuh burst, butuh shield/anti-mati","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-autoattack","items":"Spikemail / Ominous Premonition","why":"Musuh mengandalkan serangan biasa","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":167,"en":"Wukong","cn":"孙悟空","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Jangan cast skill ke Wukong pas skill 1 aktif. Hero tipis selalu perhatiin posisinya dan jaga jarak.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":174,"strength":"hard","why":"Skill 2 Consort Yu kebal damage fisik dan ult-nya bikin jarak. Wukong gampang dibales."},{"hero":170,"strength":"soft","why":"Ult kebal control plus damage jarak deket ngalahin assassin burst."},{"hero":163,"strength":"soft","why":"Damage Wukong di awal kecil. Walaupun kena satu combo, Ukyo bisa control terus ult buat balikin banyak HP, sedangkan Wukong gak bisa bertahan di lane dan kepaksa pulang. Skill Ukyo jangkauannya jauh dan clear wave cepet, jadi bisa neken Wukong dari awal. Di late, build semi-tank Ukyo juga gampang ngelawan dia."},{"hero":522,"strength":"soft","why":"Mobilitas buat ngindarin burst, dan reset menang di adu panjang."},{"hero":121,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Assassin"]},{"id":117,"en":"Wuyan","cn":"钟无艳","aliases":[],"roles":["clash","jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Hero tipis jaga jarak aman, sekali kena petrify gampang mati. 2) Pas teamfight jangan ngumpul kerapetan, ult Wuyan kasih damage dan control gede.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":123,"why":"Basic attack Lu Bu kasih true damage yang nembus shield Wuyan, padahal itu sumber utama ketahanannya.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":133,"why":"Di Renjie unggul kiting pakai slow dari basic attack, dan skill 2-nya ngebersihin control Wuyan. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":135,"strength":"soft","why":"Stat tank dan displacement menang adu melee, burst-nya gak bisa bunuh."},{"hero":126,"strength":"soft","why":"Wuyan punya control dan dash, tapi di late pas item udah jadi dia kalah jauh dari Dun. Control Wuyan ada batas waktunya dan damage-nya kurang, sedangkan Dun punya true damage dan pasif regen HP."},{"hero":537,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-heal","items":"Mortal Punisher (fisik) / Venomous Staff (magic)","why":"Musuh mengandalkan heal/lifesteal","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":135,"en":"Xiang Yu","cn":"项羽","aliases":[],"roles":["clash","roam"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Xiang Yu itu tank tebel, jangan buang damage ke dia pas teamfight. 2) Skill 1-nya bisa dihindarin. 3) Assassin masuk abis dia pakai control.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":503,"strength":"hard","why":"Ult Biron kasih shield gede dan skill 1-nya balikin HP, jadi dia unggul trade lawan Xiang Yu."},{"hero":126,"why":"Shield, true damage, dan control Dun ngacak ritme trade Xiang Yu.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":141,"why":"Dash berulang dan kebal Diaochan bikin skill Xiang Yu meleset, sementara dia terus nguras HP Xiang Yu.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":121,"strength":"hard","why":"Sustain dan ult untargetable tahan lawan damage tank yang rendah."},{"hero":124,"strength":"soft","why":"Zona di tanah plus kiting. Tank udah kebakar sebelum nyampe backline."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Tank"]},{"id":106,"en":"Xiao Qiao","cn":"小乔","aliases":[],"roles":["mid"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Jangan jalan lurus. 2) Pas teamfight pakai assassin buat bunuh Xiao Qiao. 3) Simpen control buat ngunci terus bunuh dia.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":182,"why":"Gan & Mo jangkauannya jauh banget dan bisa one-combo Xiao Qiao yang tipis dari jarak aman.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":513,"why":"Shangguan untargetable pas terbang dan bisa solo kill Xiao Qiao di level 4 sebelum dia punya item kebal.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":137,"why":"Sima Yi punya dash jauh dan silence. Dia tinggal masuk abis Xiao Qiao buang skill, terus bunuh.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":153,"why":"Stealth Gao Changgong deketin Xiao Qiao yang gak punya dash, terus bunuh dia abis skill-nya kebuang.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":107,"strength":"soft","why":"Pas teamfight Xiao Qiao biasanya main aman di belakang. Zilong tinggal tunggu dia nongol, terus buka duluan pakai ult. Zilong yang itemnya udah jadi lumayan tebel dan sakit, jadi bisa bunuh Xiao Qiao sambil tetep hidup. Kalau ult kena, bareng mid laner Xiao Qiao hampir pasti mati."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Mage"]},{"id":195,"en":"Xuance","cn":"百里玄策","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"Xuance damage-nya tinggi dan punya control, jungler kuat di early-mid. Selain ngindarin sabitnya, bisa dilawan pakai Liu Bei/Arthur/Pangu/Musashi (jungle), Kongming/Diaochan/Mozi/Liang/Gao (mage), Fuzi/Guan Yu/Meng Tian/Sun Ce (fighter), Arli/Di Renjie (marksman), Lian Po/Donghuang (support).","naturalCounters":[{"hero":133,"why":"Skill 2 Di Renjie ngebersihin hook Xuance, jadi Xuance gak bisa lanjut ke ult dan cuma sisa basic attack. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":130,"strength":"soft","why":"Musashi bisa langsung ult pas kena hook Xuance buat lepas dari hook, terus bales. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch."},{"hero":153,"strength":"soft","why":"Stealth burst dia sebelum hook kena."},{"hero":115,"why":"Pas Gao kena hook Xuance, ult-nya langsung dinyalain. Damage area terus-terusan ngehukum Xuance yang nempel. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"soft"},{"hero":137,"strength":"soft","why":"Silence batalin persiapan hook."}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-autoattack","items":"Spikemail / Ominous Premonition","why":"Musuh mengandalkan serangan biasa","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Assassin"]},{"id":178,"en":"Yang Jian","cn":"杨戬","aliases":[],"roles":["clash","jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Hindarin skill 1 dan 3 Yang Jian pakai gerakan lincah. 2) Kalau kena skill 1-nya, jangan langsung dash. Tunggu dia pakai tahap kedua, baru dash menjauh. 3) Pas teamfight jangan pakai control kunci ke dia.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":141,"strength":"soft","why":"Skill 2 Diaochan kasih kebal sesaat buat ngindarin control Yang Jian. Dari artikel setelah rework (2025)."},{"hero":198,"strength":"soft","why":"Shield dan sustain Menki nyerap all-in. Damage Yang Jian abis duluan sebelum HP Menki abis."},{"hero":121,"strength":"soft","why":"Ult untargetable Mi Yue ngindarin all-in Yang Jian, dan sustain di lane ngalahin burst-nya."},{"hero":111,"strength":"soft","why":"Kiting dan dash ngindarin combo true damage."},{"hero":556,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":125,"en":"Yango","cn":"元歌","aliases":[],"roles":["clash"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Boneka gak dapet pasif perlindungan, dan bunuh bonekanya bikin Yango pingsan. 2) Cari badan asli Yango biar dia kepaksa berhenti ngendaliin boneka.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":153,"strength":"soft","why":"Gao Changgong yang stealth bisa nemuin badan asli Yango terus bunuh dia satu combo."},{"hero":180,"why":"Ult Nezha yang se-map ngebuka posisi badan asli Yango dan bisa ngejar dia.","strength":"s