["Mage"]},{"id":113,"en":"Zhuangzi","cn":"庄周","aliases":[],"roles":["roam"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Pancing ult Zhuangzi dulu sebelum full nyerang. 2) Zhuangzi lemah kalau sendirian, bisa di-pick-off. 3) Dia tank, jangan buang damage dan control ke dia.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":132,"why":"Marco Polo gak ngandelin control, jadi kebal control Zhuangzi gak ngaruh, dan dia lincah buat kiting. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":141,"strength":"soft","why":"Zhuangzi gak punya hard CC maupun dash, jadi Diaochan bebas nari-nari pakai true damage di sekitarnya."},{"hero":146,"strength":"soft","why":"Tanpa control, Zhuangzi gak bisa ngehentiin loop reset Luna. Ujung-ujungnya dia cuma jadi sasaran dash gratis."},{"hero":514,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":585,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[{"tag":"anti-cc","items":"Boots of Resistance + Purify (spell)","why":"Musuh punya banyak crowd control","needsReview":true},{"tag":"anti-tank","items":"Overlord's Might / Starbreaker (armor pen)","why":"Musuh tebal, butuh penetrasi","needsReview":true}],"classes":["Support"]},{"id":107,"en":"Zilong","cn":"赵云","aliases":[],"roles":["jungle"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Hero tipis jaga jarak aman biar dia gak bisa nempel. 2) Zilong late kuat banget 1v1, assassin biasa jangan maksa duel.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":120,"why":"Ult Bai Qi langsung nge-taunt Zilong sebelum atau sesudah ult Zilong, jadi Zilong gampang dibunuh. Artikel lama, bisa berubah karena patch.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":531,"strength":"hard","why":"Jing tinggal pakai klon cermin buat ngindarin ult Zilong sekalian reset cooldown. Menang adu burst, abis itu snowball."},{"hero":149,"strength":"soft","why":"Shield global dan teleport ngelindungin dari dive, damage reduction numpulin burst."},{"hero":146,"strength":"soft","why":null},{"hero":170,"strength":"soft","why":null}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Fighter"]},{"id":148,"en":"Ziya","cn":"姜子牙","aliases":[],"roles":["mid","roam"],"howToPlayAgainst":"1) Pas pulang dengan HP rendah waspadain ult jarak jauh Ziya. 2) Ziya gak punya dash dan tipis, cari momen masuk. 3) Jangan berdiri rapet pas teamfight. 4) Begitu kelihatan lintasan ult-nya, langsung ngindar.","naturalCounters":[{"hero":142,"why":"Ult Angela kasih kebal control, jadi control Ziya gak bisa ngehentiin dia, dan satu combo bisa bunuh Ziya yang tipis tanpa dash.","strength":"hard"},{"hero":513,"strength":"soft","why":"Burst dive ke mage yang gak bisa gerak. Ziya gak bakal tahan kena full combo."}],"itemCounters":[],"classes":["Mage"]}]}